# Rover 400 R8 (four-door saloon), 1990-1995.
#
# The Rover 400 R8 was the saloon version of the Rover 200 R8, launched in April
# 1990 and positioned slightly upmarket of the hatchback, in the way the Ford Orion
# stood above the Escort. It shared the front end, cabin and wheelbase with the 200
# and replaced the SD3 as Rover's small saloon. Saloon production ended in 1995;
# the Tourer estate continued to 1998.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rover_400_/_45
# https://rover200.org.uk/cars/r8/r8-history
#
# Dimensions 4.370 x 1.680 x 1.400 m, wheelbase 2.550 m. Only the length changes
# from the 200 R8, by 150 mm behind the rear doors; the published R8 dimension box
# gives both bodies.
#
# Colours: Flame Red (BLVC 818), Silver Leaf metallic (421), White Diamond (655)
# and Moonraker Blue metallic (424). DVSA first-registration shares begin at 1994,
# so the split is era-adjusted from the 1994-96 measured base: red 5, silver 5,
# white 3, blue 3. Total 16. Provisional pending the central rebase.
#
# Speed 175 km/h, as the 200 R8: the saloon shared the engine range. Comfort
# 90/465, on the line 330 + 1.5 x 90, and equal to the hatchback, which shared the
# bodyshell and suspension. Classes 0,1,2.
#
# Dates are road presence, not production: April 1990 intro, retires staggered
# 2002-2006 on a twelve- to sixteen-year tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/rover-400-r8.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/rover-400-r8.dae (59 objects). Variant of the Rover 200 R8 master.
# References: citycars/references/rover-400-r8/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons,
# CC BY-SA 4.0).
#
# Accepted low-poly deviations, recorded rather than corrected: the faceted
# surfaces stand in for the photographed compound curves, and the pre-facelift
# front is used for the whole run although the reference car is a 1993 facelifted
# 414 Si. The 1992 facelift changed grille and lamp detail only, and the 200 R8
# carries the same pre-facelift treatment, so the family stays consistent.

obj=citycar
name=Rover400R8(FlameRed)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=5
intro_year=1990
intro_month=4
retire_year=2003
retire_month=6
speed=175
length=3
class=0,1,2
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=90
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=465

